  "description": "The game includes four-player mahjong, two-player mahjong, and even three-player mahjong! Start a match right away based on how many players are gathered!\n*This game features RIICHI MAHJONG, a Japanese-style mahjong game.\n\nCasually play online matches with mahjong fans from all over the country!\nSupports national rankings! Aim to become the top mahjong player in the country!\n\nPlay the robust online mode and get a variety of avatars!\nAnother great feature is that you can play mini-games against the CPU while waiting for a match to be set up, ensuring a comfortable online gaming experience.\n\nIt’s not just online! It’s incredibly fun to play solo, too!\nWe’ve prepared Free Play where you can play under your preferred conditions, an Arcade Mode where you clear stages, and Ranking Challenges where you compete with all users for the highest score when clearing objectives!\n\nFeaturing beautiful graphics and exhilarating effects, this latest installment of authentic 3D online mahjong fully utilizes Nintendo Switch™ 2-exclusive features like mouse controls and GameShare!",
